.TH MAZE 1
.SH NAME
maze \- maze editor and solver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/maze
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Maze
is a port of the TempleOS
.B Demo/Games/Maze.HC
maze editor and solver.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 1 draws walls; button 2 solves a path from the clicked cell, a
depth-first walk that backs up when it runs out of directions.  Two beeps
when it gets out.  The c key clears the grid.
.PP
The original is a demonstration of the text base layer: that layer is
cleared thirty times a second, so the program keeps its own permanent
array of characters and copies it in every frame, then prints the two
lines of instructions over the top.  Those two lines are drawn here too.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB
Draw walls
.TP
.B RMB
Solve from cell
.TP
.B c
Clear
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/maze.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
